  "detail": null,
  "summary": "I ran CRC outreach under RBC-QM-02 for \"Okafor CRC 2026\" (14 members). Six patients have an open gap. Each got a new mailed FIT kit order and a portal message about it. A seventh open gap (pt-0024) already had an active FIT order, so per §5 I didn't place a second one. I sent her a reminder about the existing kit instead.\n\nRules used: the measurement period is 2026, and age is taken on 2026-12-31. Look-back windows are 2026 for FIT, 2024–2026 for sDNA-FIT, 2022–2026 for CT colonography/sigmoidoscopy and 2017–2026 for colonoscopy.\n\n| Patient | Age 12/31/26 | Status | Reason | Action |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| pt-0009 Elly Trantow | 72 | Excluded | 66 or older, with active frailty (since 2025-09-16) and a dementia medication: donepezil, active since 2025-06-10 (§4 frailty + advanced illness) | None |\n| pt-0011 Marilu Gaona | 76 | Not in population | Older than 75 | None |\n| pt-0014 Santo Pagac | 55 | Screening up to date | Colonoscopy 2018-05-21, within the 10-year window | None |\n| pt-0017 Stephan Herman | 54 | Open gap | Last colonoscopy 2016-11-15, outside the window; no other screening | FIT kit sr-t0001 + message comm-t0007 |\n| pt-0018 Lance Muller | 53 | Open gap | sDNA-FIT 2023-11-20, outside the 3-year window | FIT kit sr-t0002 + message comm-t0008 |\n| pt-0019 Harrison O'Keefe | 69 | Open gap | No screening on record. Frailty (2026) without advanced illness or a dementia medication, so not excluded | FIT kit sr-t0003 + message comm-t0009 |\n| pt-0020 Kelsie Rohan | 52 | Excluded | Hospice care since 2026-08-20 (pancreatic cancer) | None |\n| pt-0021 Ángela Vigil | 52 | Excluded | Total proctocolectomy 2015-06-03, from a scanned outside operative report (doc-00067) | None |\n| pt-0022 Tiny Koss | 52 | Open gap | Last FIT 2025-12-03, before the 2026 period | FIT kit sr-t0004 + message comm-t0010 |\n| pt-0023 Burma Leuschke | 46 | Open gap | Turns 46 on 2026-12-15, so in the population; never screened | FIT kit sr-t0005 + message comm-t0011 |\n| pt-0024 Delaine MacGyver | 51 | Open gap | Last FOBT 2024-06-11, before 2026 | Active FIT order sr-00003 (2026-09-30) already exists, so no duplicate. Reminder comm-t0013 about that kit |\n| pt-0025 Danika Ullrich | 51 | Screening up to date | CT colonography 2022-03-08, within the 5-year window | None |\n| pt-0034 Rickey Sipes | 72 | Excluded | 66 or older and living long term in a nursing home (housing status 2026-02-10) | None |\n| pt-0035 Elvin Wolff | 68 | Open gap | No screening on record. The May 2026 skilled nursing stay was short-term rehab; housing status 2026-06-01 says he lives in his own home, so not excluded | FIT kit sr-t0006 + message comm-t0012 |\n\n**Totals:** 2 up to date, 7 open gaps (6 new FIT orders plus 1 existing order), 4 excluded, 1 not in the population.\n\n**Limitation:** to find stool tests I searched by the standard FIT/FOBT/sDNA-FIT lab codes, not every lab result. A stool test recorded under another code or as text only could have been missed.",
